{
 "about": "Golden cases for 'Usable by' (CF-106, Nico 2026-11-07): the class can EVER use the item: class-only items by AllowableClass (bit classID-1; -1, 0 or missing = every class), the armor types the class reaches by level 60 (mail for hunters and shamans and plate for warriors and paladins come at 40, but count), shields, relics, and the weapon types the class can learn in Classic. No level, no trained skills. Quest drops and anything that is not armor (4) or a weapon (2) are usable. Owner: the addon (tests/spec/DungeonLoot_spec.lua); the site copies this file byte for byte.",
